  "findings": [
    "board-ardbeg.c explicitly registers RT5671 at I2C bus 0 address 0x1c and TFA amplifiers at 0x34/0x37.",
    "The same board file registers the RT5671 machine with codec-master I2S, 48 kHz, 16-bit stereo.",
    "Palmas PMIC, fixed regulator and board power sources are byte-identical to the previously inspected MiCode reference. They do not identify a new untested power rail.",
    "dbvdd and avdd map to the existing always-on 1.8 V rail; ldoen is an active-high Palmas GPIO6 fixed 1.2 V supply.",
    "The referenced recursive kernel tree contains rt5671.c but no sound/soc/tegra/tegra_rt5671.c; presence of a config option does not establish a complete buildable machine driver.",
    "The device nvaudio configuration refers to tegrart5639, so its card name is not a verified Mocha mainline routing specification.",
    "The Stagefright OMX plugin dynamically loads proprietary libnvomx.so; it is a loader, not an open implementation of the VDE bitstream engine."
  ],
